  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "模式分岔（App.vue:23 · stores/conversation.ts:93）",
      "items": [
        "isEmbedded = URL 带 embed=true 或 window.parent≠window（stores/conversation.ts:93-96）",
        "独立态 getHostPort 返回 NullHostPort：connected=false、无 apply 能力（composables/hostPort.ts:315-358）",
        "挂载即 loadConversations() 拉历史会话；INIT 握手仅嵌入态走（App.vue:54-78）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "三栏组装与懒创建（layouts/StandaloneLayout.vue:16-71）",
      "items": [
        "248px 会话侧栏（新建/切换/删除）+ ChatPanel 聊天区 + 40% ResultPanel 制品栏",
        "新建对话只重置本地不落库，会话 id 由首条消息 result 事件回传（stores/conversation.ts:191-196,295-298）",
        "点历史会话：dataArtifact 同构合成 formattedData，刷新后图表卡不消失（stores/conversation.ts:151-176）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "结果交互与回滚（components/chat/ChatPanel.vue:120-240）",
      "items": [
        "config 卡与 data 卡互斥分流；独立模式无 apply 能力→「复制 JSON」逃生口（ChatPanel.vue:167-180）",
        "回滚=git checkout 式只切制品：对话保留、diff 基线取切换前版本（ChatPanel.vue:730-761）",
        "独立模式 diff 基线兜底为上一份 AI 产出（stores/conversation.ts:369-372）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "链路追踪与 token 回填（components/chat/TurnTraceModal.vue）",
      "items": [
        "数据来自 GET /api/conversations/{id}/trace?turn=N——引擎级打点，任何 pack 可用（TurnTraceModal.vue:60,111）",
        "轮次=该消息前的 user 消息数，与后端 _build_trace 同口径（ChatPanel.vue:557-568）",
        "assistant 制品快照不进时间线，只留过程性活动（TurnTraceModal.vue:133-135）",
        "轮末 streaming→false 拉单轮 trace：消息卡回填 LLM 次数/token，输入框累计常显（ChatPanel.vue:828-851）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "制品面板（components/json/ResultPanel.vue · JsonDiffView.vue）",
      "items": [
        "有数据制品默认数据视图，数据/配置并存可切换（ResultPanel.vue:123-128）",
        "JsonDiffView：2 缩进序列化 + LCS 行级 diff，红删绿增/双侧行号/增删统计（JsonDiffView.vue:52-64）",
        "复制/下载走浏览器原生 API；「应用」按钮仅嵌入模式渲染（ResultPanel.vue:27,160-176）"
      ]
    }
  ]
